{
  "nl": "活动分组管理：表格行内编辑，单击单元格修改；展示活动名称、渠道、投放量，其中渠道与投放量归入投放信息分组；支持编辑。",
  "nlEn": "Campaign grouping: the table edits inline — click a cell to change it. Shows campaign name, channel, and reach, where channel and reach are grouped under placement info. Supports edit.",
  "fixedFields": ["campaignName", "channel", "reach"],
  "pinnedDims": ["propSet", "actions", "editConfig", "columns", "mode"],
  "config": {
    "name": "CampaignGroupEditManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/campaign",
    "target": "vue3",
    "fields": [
      { "prop": "campaignName", "label": "活动名称", "formtype": "Input" },
      { "prop": "channel", "label": "渠道", "formtype": "Input", "inQuery": false },
      { "prop": "reach", "label": "投放量", "formtype": "InputNumber", "inQuery": false }
    ],
    "tableOptions": { "engine": "vxe", "editConfig": { "mode": "cell" } },
    "columns": [
      { "prop": "campaignName", "label": "活动名称" },
      {
        "label": "投放信息",
        "groups": [
          { "prop": "channel", "label": "渠道", "editRender": { "name": "$input" } },
          { "prop": "reach", "label": "投放量", "editRender": { "name": "$input", "props": { "type": "number" } } }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "actions": ["edit"]
  },
  "notes": "AI-09 子项④: vxe 行内编辑 + 列分组共存（列组子列带 editRender，vue3/schema）；分组键用运行时契约 groups（TableColumn.groups），AN-08 前误写成 children —— 那是树表子节点的键，不是表头分组"
}
